==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Hidden Fates|Eevee|49}} from the {{TCG|Hidden Fates}} expansion.
*'''Continuous Steps''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Eevee|205}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

